      "string_id": "kaligula_planshet_dialog_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "We're good man, shit, things got pretty intense there for a second! It's crazy they didn't manage to hit even one of us. Fuck 'em, hope the mutants piss on their corpses. Listen, man, why don't you go over to that prick who owes us money and find out what he's got in his pockets? I've gotta have a smoke to calm the nerves, my hands are still shaking.",
      "JA_current": "We're good man, shit, things got pretty intense there for a second! It's crazy they didn't manage to hit even one of us. Fuck 'em, hope the mutants piss on their corpses. Listen, man, why don't you go over to that prick who owes us money and find out what he's got in his pockets? I've gotta have a smoke to calm the nerves, my hands are still shaking.",
      "JA_new": "ああ、何とかな。さっきはひどいことになりかけた！　誰も撃たれなかったのが不思議なくらいだ。あいつらなんかくたばっちまえ。死体にミュータントが小便をかけてくれりゃいい。なあ、金を借りてるあの野郎のところへ行って、ポケットを探ってきてくれないか？　俺は一服して落ち着く。まだ手が震えてるんだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
